I18N.nl={"Website by": "Website door", "Privacy": "Privacy", "Terms": "Voorwaarden", "By sending your request you agree to the": "Door je aanvraag te versturen ga je akkoord met de", "terms": "voorwaarden", "and the": "en de", "privacy policy": "privacyverklaring", "Tattoos": "Tattoos", "About": "Over mij", "Booking": "Boeken", "Healing": "Nazorg", "Shop": "Shop", "Contact": "Contact", "Book now": "Boek nu", "Traditional tattoo artist · Antwerp": "Traditional tattoo artist · Antwerpen", "Powerful.<br>Timeless.<br><span>Personal.</span>": "Krachtig.<br>Tijdloos.<br><span>Persoonlijk.</span>", "Modern &amp; aesthetic traditional tattoo artist based in Antwerp, working from a private studio by appointment. Rooted in traditional western tattooing, adding a bit of new imagery and creativity. Classic and bold, to withstand time, fading and trendyness.": "Moderne &amp; esthetische traditional tattoo artist in Antwerpen, werkend vanuit een privéstudio op afspraak. Geworteld in het traditionele westerse tatoeëren, aangevuld met nieuwe beelden en creativiteit. Klassiek en bold, bestand tegen de tijd, vervaging en trends.", "Working from flash and happy to create custom pieces.": "Ik werk vanuit flash en maak met plezier custom ontwerpen.", "Book an appointment": "Maak een afspraak", "See the work": "Bekijk het werk", "years of experience": "jaar ervaring", "One-on-one": "Eén-op-één", "private studio": "privéstudio", "Antwerp · by appointment": "Antwerpen · op afspraak", "Latest work on Instagram": "Recent werk op Instagram", "The work": "Het werk", "Clean lines, solid colour and strong contrasts. Careful placement, and work that stays readable for many years. Click a piece to see it large, click a tag to filter.": "Strakke lijnen, volle kleur en sterke contrasten. Zorgvuldige plaatsing, en werk dat nog jaren leesbaar blijft. Klik op een tattoo om ze groot te zien, klik op een tag om te filteren.", "Who I am": "Wie ik ben", "I'm Tobias.": "Ik ben Tobias.", "A tattoo artist with more than 10 years of experience, and a creative background that started long before I entered the tattoo world.": "Een tattoo artist met meer dan 10 jaar ervaring, en een creatieve achtergrond die lang voor mijn intrede in de tattoowereld begon.", "I have been drawing my entire life, from art classes as a child to painting courses and a long graffiti history. It all shaped my sense of line, rhythm and contrast.": "Ik teken al mijn hele leven, van tekenacademie als kind tot schildercursussen en een lange graffitigeschiedenis. Het vormde allemaal mijn gevoel voor lijn, ritme en contrast.", "As an adult, I founded the graphic design studio <a href=\"https://afreux.be/web/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">afreux.be</a> with two friends. We worked in music, the cultural sector, NGOs and personal artistic projects. My years in design taught me to think in composition, balance, typography and visual clarity. These elements now flow naturally into my tattoo work.": "Als volwassene richtte ik met twee vrienden de grafische studio <a href=\"https://afreux.be/web/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">afreux.be</a> op. We werkten voor muziek, de culturele sector, ngo’s en persoonlijke artistieke projecten. Mijn jaren in design leerden me denken in compositie, balans, typografie en visuele helderheid. Die elementen vloeien nu vanzelf door in mijn tattoowerk.", "I started tattooing under the wings of Tomas Redrey and Younes at Brabo's Hand, came as a guest to Nuit Noire Tattoo, Purple Sun and Papanatos, and as a regular at True Blue Tattoo. Also events like Us By Night, Brussels Tattoo Convention, True Blue Convention, True Love Convention, etc.": "Ik begon met tatoeëren onder de vleugels van Tomas Redrey en Younes bij Brabo’s Hand, was te gast bij Nuit Noire Tattoo, Purple Sun en Papanatos, en vaste waarde bij True Blue Tattoo. Daarnaast events als Us By Night, Brussels Tattoo Convention, True Blue Convention, True Love Convention, enz.", "My style": "Mijn stijl", "Timeless, bold &amp; designed for the body": "Tijdloos, bold &amp; ontworpen voor het lichaam", "I work within classic Western and American Traditional tattooing and combine this with a modern, graphic approach. A traditional base, on which a layer of personal influence and style is added. More modern imagery, objects and influences are mixed into the subtle outcome. I consciously remain very loyal stylewise through time — away from trends and fashion.": "Ik werk binnen het klassieke Western en American Traditional tatoeëren en combineer dat met een moderne, grafische aanpak. Een traditionele basis, waarop een laag persoonlijke invloed en stijl komt. Modernere beelden, objecten en invloeden worden subtiel in het resultaat verwerkt. Ik blijf bewust heel trouw aan mijn stijl door de jaren heen — weg van trends en mode.", "Clean lines": "Strakke lijnen", "Solid colour": "Volle kleur", "Strong contrasts": "Sterke contrasten", "Long-term readability": "Leesbaar op lange termijn", "Careful placement": "Zorgvuldige plaatsing", "I always design with the healing process in mind. Lines and shapes are chosen because they hold up well on the skin, both today and many years from now. The pigments and my colour palette are chosen through years of experience to stay saturated and bright.": "Ik ontwerp altijd met het genezingsproces in gedachten. Lijnen en vormen worden gekozen omdat ze goed standhouden op de huid, vandaag én over vele jaren. De pigmenten en mijn kleurenpalet zijn door jaren ervaring gekozen om verzadigd en helder te blijven.", "I do not follow fast-fading trends. I focus on craftsmanship that lasts. Placement — for both now and future plans — is always carefully taken into account, as well as making my work blend with that of other artists.": "Ik volg geen snel vervagende trends. Ik focus op vakmanschap dat blijft. Plaatsing — voor nu én voor toekomstige plannen — wordt altijd zorgvuldig meegenomen, net als het laten samengaan van mijn werk met dat van andere artiesten.", "How I work": "Hoe ik werk", "Honest, focused &amp; one-on-one": "Eerlijk, gefocust &amp; één-op-één", "In my private studio, I work with one client at a time. This gives us time to talk through your idea and space to refine it. I share the space and approach with Warren Moris, who's always open for input.": "In mijn privéstudio werk ik met één klant tegelijk. Zo is er tijd om je idee te bespreken en ruimte om het te verfijnen. Ik deel de ruimte en aanpak met Warren Moris, die altijd openstaat voor input.", "You can expect a calm and professional atmosphere, honest advice and clear communication without sales talk.": "Je mag een rustige, professionele sfeer verwachten, eerlijk advies en duidelijke communicatie zonder verkooppraat.", "I see a tattoo as a collaboration. It is your idea combined with my experience, and we work together in a direct and open way. If it doesn't feel right, both me and the client can agree not to go further — luckily that rarely happens.": "Ik zie een tattoo als een samenwerking. Het is jouw idee gecombineerd met mijn ervaring, en we werken direct en open samen. Als het niet goed voelt, kunnen zowel ik als de klant beslissen om niet verder te gaan — gelukkig gebeurt dat zelden.", "Why clients choose Tattoo Tobias": "Waarom klanten voor Tattoo Tobias kiezen", "What you can count on.": "Waar je op kunt rekenen.", "A combination of craftsmanship and graphic design, resulting in clear and strong artwork.": "Een combinatie van vakmanschap en grafisch ontwerp, met heldere en sterke artwork als resultaat.", "A quiet private studio with full focus and no distractions — safe and respectful for all.": "Een rustige privéstudio met volle focus en zonder afleiding — veilig en respectvol voor iedereen.", "Honest and direct communication, so you always know what works and what does not.": "Eerlijke en directe communicatie, zodat je altijd weet wat werkt en wat niet.", "Rooted in classic Western tattooing, refined for today.": "Geworteld in klassiek westers tatoeëren, verfijnd voor vandaag.", "Solid experience in traditional tattooing with a strong focus on healing and long-term readability.": "Gedegen ervaring in traditional tatoeëren met sterke focus op genezing en leesbaarheid op lange termijn.", "An artistic yet personal approach, with genuine care for every client.": "Een artistieke maar persoonlijke aanpak, met oprechte zorg voor elke klant.", "Reviews": "Reviews", "What clients say": "Wat klanten zeggen", "Read all reviews on Google": "Lees alle reviews op Google", "Thanks a lot for showing interest in my work! Pick a free slot right here and tell me what you have in mind. Nothing that suits you — evenings, or my days off? Fill in the rest anyway, or send an email, and we'll find a moment together.": "Bedankt voor je interesse in mijn werk! Kies hier een vrij moment en vertel me wat je in gedachten hebt. Past er niets — ’s avonds, of op mijn vrije dagen? Vul de rest toch in, of stuur een e-mail, dan vinden we samen een moment.", "<strong>Pick a slot &amp; send your idea</strong>Choose how much time you'll need, a free day and a time. Add your general idea, placement, black or color and reference pictures. The slot is held for you straight away.": "<strong>Kies een moment &amp; stuur je idee</strong>Kies hoeveel tijd je nodig hebt, een vrije dag en een uur. Voeg je algemene idee, plaatsing, zwart of kleur en referentiebeelden toe. Het moment wordt meteen voor je vastgehouden.", "<strong>We fine-tune the design together</strong>I can sketch in advance and send it the week before for feedback, or draw it out on the appointment. Together we make the final drawing, keeping details to size and placement in mind. There are a lot of line drawings ready to go as well.": "<strong>We verfijnen het ontwerp samen</strong>Ik kan op voorhand schetsen en het de week ervoor doorsturen voor feedback, of het uittekenen tijdens de afspraak. Samen maken we de definitieve tekening, met details afgestemd op formaat en plaatsing. Er liggen ook heel wat lijntekeningen klaar.", "<strong>I confirm</strong>I check your idea and confirm your slot by email — or suggest a different day or duration if the piece needs it. I can give you an estimated price if I have enough information. Once confirmed, I may ask you to pay a €50 deposit.": "<strong>Ik bevestig</strong>Ik bekijk je idee en bevestig je moment per e-mail — of stel een andere dag of duur voor als de tattoo dat vraagt. Als ik genoeg informatie heb, kan ik een richtprijs geven. Na bevestiging kan ik een voorschot van €50 vragen.", "<strong>Tattoo day</strong>One client at a time, in a calm private studio. A piece you can wear with pride.": "<strong>Tattoodag</strong>Eén klant tegelijk, in een rustige privéstudio. Een tattoo die je met trots draagt.", "Consultation or browsing flash": "Consultatie of flash bekijken", "Touch-up or a small tattoo": "Touch-up of een kleine tattoo", "Palm- and hand-size tattoos": "Tattoos ter grootte van een handpalm of hand", "Fronts, backs, multiple tattoos, back pieces, day sessions": "Voorkant, rug, meerdere tattoos, backpieces, dagsessies", "<strong>Tip:</strong> give me your phone number for any short-notice communication.": "<strong>Tip:</strong> geef me je telefoonnummer voor communicatie op korte termijn.", "<strong>Tip:</strong> stick to the email conversation. Using different channels for a single project creates confusion and errors.": "<strong>Tip:</strong> hou het bij de e-mailconversatie. Verschillende kanalen voor één project zorgen voor verwarring en fouten.", "Request an appointment": "Vraag een afspraak aan", "Choose how much time you'll need, pick a free day and time if you can, and tell me your idea. I confirm personally.": "Kies hoeveel tijd je nodig hebt, kies indien mogelijk een vrije dag en uur, en vertel me je idee. Ik bevestig persoonlijk.", "Required. Everything else helps me prepare, but is optional.": "Verplicht. Al de rest helpt me bij de voorbereiding, maar is optioneel.", "1 · How much time?": "1 · Hoeveel tijd?", "2 · Which day?": "2 · Welke dag?", "optional": "optioneel", "3 · What time?": "3 · Hoe laat?", "Name": "Naam", "Email": "E-mail", "Phone number": "Telefoonnummer", "Your general idea": "Je algemene idee", "Placement": "Plaatsing", "Approximate size": "Geschatte grootte", "Black or color": "Zwart of kleur", "Not sure yet": "Nog niet zeker", "Black": "Zwart", "Color": "Kleur", "Reference material": "Referentiemateriaal", "Add reference photos": "Voeg referentiefoto’s toe", "drag them here or tap to choose · up to 8 photos": "sleep ze hierheen of tik om te kiezen · max. 8 foto’s", "Is the tattoo going between existing ones? Please add a photo of the spot.": "Komt de tattoo tussen bestaande tattoos? Voeg dan een foto van de plek toe.", "Send my request": "Verstuur mijn aanvraag", "Prefer email?": "Liever e-mail?", "Request sent": "Aanvraag verstuurd", "Tobias checks your idea and confirms by email, or suggests another time if the tattoo needs a different slot. You may be asked to pay a €50 deposit to make it final.": "Tobias bekijkt je idee en bevestigt per e-mail, of stelt een ander moment voor als de tattoo een andere duur vraagt. Mogelijk wordt een voorschot van €50 gevraagd om het definitief te maken.", "Send another request": "Nog een aanvraag versturen", "Aftercare": "Nazorg", "Keep in mind: good aftercare is part of a good end result. Four phases, a few do's and don'ts.": "Onthoud: goede nazorg is deel van een goed eindresultaat. Vier fasen, een paar do’s en don’ts.", "First hours": "Eerste uren", "Foil &amp; first wash": "Folie &amp; eerste wasbeurt", "Keep the foil for at least three hours or overnight. Wash your hands with soap before handling your new tattoo.": "Laat de folie minstens drie uur of een nacht zitten. Was je handen met zeep voor je je nieuwe tattoo aanraakt.", "Remove the foil and wash the tattoo carefully with your hands to remove all surface blood, sweat and ink. To avoid irritation from the tape, remove the foil after a few minutes of showering.": "Verwijder de folie en was de tattoo voorzichtig met je handen om bloed, zweet en inkt aan de oppervlakte weg te halen. Om irritatie door de tape te vermijden, haal je de folie pas weg na enkele minuten douchen.", "Clean with just water — pH-neutral soap can be used, but no normal soap. Rinse, then let it dry in open air or pat dry with a clean towel.": "Reinig met alleen water — pH-neutrale zeep mag, gewone zeep niet. Spoel af, laat aan de lucht drogen of dep droog met een schone handdoek.", "Day 1 – 14": "Dag 1 – 14", "Thin layer of cream": "Dun laagje crème", "We advise Cicaplast B5 or Easy Tattoo. Always apply a thin layer of ointment, 3 to 6 times a day for at least 14 days to maintain hydration.": "We raden Cicaplast B5 of Easy Tattoo aan. Breng altijd een dun laagje zalf aan, 3 tot 6 keer per dag gedurende minstens 14 dagen, om de huid gehydrateerd te houden.", "It helps the tattoo settle nicely if you keep going for an extra 2 weeks.": "Het helpt de tattoo mooi te settelen als je nog 2 weken extra doorgaat.", "You may refilm for two nights to avoid stains in your bed — also if you have a dirty job. Keep your tattoo open for the rest of the time.": "Je mag twee nachten opnieuw folie aanbrengen om vlekken in je bed te vermijden — ook als je vuil werk doet. Laat je tattoo de rest van de tijd open.", "Day 3 – 7 and on": "Dag 3 – 7 en verder", "Peeling &amp; scabbing": "Vervellen &amp; korstjes", "The tattoo may start to peel and scab. Don't pick or peel the skin away — let it fall off naturally during washing or applying cream. Fresh skin will soon replace the dead skin.": "De tattoo kan beginnen vervellen en korstjes vormen. Niet pulken of de huid eraf trekken — laat ze vanzelf loskomen bij het wassen of insmeren. Verse huid vervangt snel de dode huid.", "The ink may fade during the process, but will return when healing is completed. Too dry skin will crust and push ink out. With a real crust, increase cream frequency — but always apply slightly: too much prevents the skin from breathing.": "De inkt kan tijdens het proces fletser lijken, maar komt terug als de genezing voltooid is. Te droge huid vormt korsten en duwt inkt naar buiten. Bij een echte korst smeer je vaker — maar altijd dun: te veel belet de huid te ademen.", "After a few months": "Na enkele maanden", "Sun": "Zon", "After a few months you may sunbathe in moderation.": "Na enkele maanden mag je met mate zonnen.", "Use sun cream, factor 50, to prevent early fading. Exposure to the sun is the major cause of tattoo fading.": "Gebruik zonnecrème, factor 50, om vroegtijdig vervagen te voorkomen. Blootstelling aan de zon is de belangrijkste oorzaak van vervagende tattoos.", "Do": "Doen", "Change your bed sheets if you have pets entering the bedroom.": "Verschoon je lakens als huisdieren in de slaapkamer komen.", "Continue applying cream as long as the tattoo feels sensitive.": "Blijf crème smeren zolang de tattoo gevoelig aanvoelt.", "Keep in mind good aftercare is part of a good end result!": "Onthoud: goede nazorg is deel van een goed eindresultaat!", "Get in touch if your tattoo needs a touch-up.": "Neem contact op als je tattoo een touch-up nodig heeft.", "Get in touch if you're worried about the healing process or have an infection.": "Neem contact op als je je zorgen maakt over de genezing of een infectie hebt.", "Don't": "Niet doen", "Apply Vaseline or petroleum-based products.": "Vaseline of producten op petroleumbasis gebruiken.", "Apply alcohol.": "Alcohol gebruiken.", "Rub, scratch or pick at the tattoo.": "Wrijven, krabben of pulken aan de tattoo.", "Expose the tattoo to direct sunlight.": "De tattoo blootstellen aan direct zonlicht.", "Swim — no sauna, no steam bath or bathtub for 3 to 4 weeks.": "Zwemmen — geen sauna, stoombad of ligbad gedurende 3 tot 4 weken.", "Happy <span>healing!</span>": "Happy <span>healing!</span>", "The shop": "De shop", "Prints and goods by Tobias De Bruyn, available in the online shop.": "Prints en goods van Tobias De Bruyn, verkrijgbaar in de online shop.", "Visit the shop ↗": "Naar de shop ↗", "Come by — by appointment": "Kom langs — op afspraak", "<a href=\"#booking\">Use the booking form</a> — pick a free slot and send your idea": "<a href=\"#booking\">Gebruik het boekingsformulier</a> — kies een vrij moment en stuur je idee", "Email · for info and booking": "E-mail · voor info en boekingen", "Tattoo studio": "Tattoostudio", "Opening": "Openingsuren", "Private studio · only by appointment": "Privéstudio · enkel op afspraak", "Route via Google Maps": "Route via Google Maps", "Photography by Jannis Bachard": "Fotografie door Jannis Bachard", "e.g. A panther head on my forearm, black. Or: I'd like to drop by first to discuss my project — which mornings at 9 or 10 suit you? Or ask for a different time slot.": "bv. Een pantherkop op mijn onderarm, zwart. Of: ik kom graag eerst langs om mijn project te bespreken — welke ochtenden om 9 of 10 uur passen? Of vraag een ander tijdstip.", "e.g. upper arm": "bv. bovenarm", "e.g. 15 cm": "bv. 15 cm", "All work": "Alle werk", "Animals": "Dieren", "Colour": "Kleur", "Show more": "Toon meer", "Enlarge": "Vergroten", "Consultation": "Consultatie", "Small": "Klein", "Medium": "Medium", "Full day": "Volledige dag", "Discuss your project or browse flash": "Je project bespreken of flash bekijken", "hour": "uur", "hours": "uur", "Previous month": "Vorige maand", "Next month": "Volgende maand", "Mo,Tu,We,Th,Fr,Sa,Su": "Ma,Di,Wo,Do,Vr,Za,Zo", "Choose how much time you need first — the free days then light up.": "Kies eerst hoeveel tijd je nodig hebt — dan lichten de vrije dagen op.", "Choose a day first — or skip this and just send your request.": "Kies eerst een dag — of sla dit over en verstuur gewoon je aanvraag.", "held for you as soon as you send": "wordt voor je vastgehouden zodra je verstuurt", "Pick a start time, or unselect the day.": "Kies een startuur, of maak de dag ongedaan.", "your name": "je naam", "a valid email address": "een geldig e-mailadres", "your phone number": "je telefoonnummer", "your idea": "je idee", "Please fill in": "Vul nog in:", "Sending…": "Versturen…", "is held for you.": "wordt voor je vastgehouden.", "No slot chosen — I'll get back to you by email with a proposal for a date.": "Geen moment gekozen — ik kom per e-mail bij je terug met een datumvoorstel.", "Sorry, that time was just taken. Please pick another one.": "Sorry, dat moment is net ingenomen. Kies een ander moment.", "Something went wrong while sending. Please try again, or email me directly.": "Er ging iets mis bij het versturen. Probeer opnieuw, of mail me rechtstreeks.", "No slot chosen": "Geen moment gekozen", "Modern traditional tattoo": "Modern traditional tattoo", "American traditional tattoo": "American traditional tattoo", "Western traditional tattoo": "Western traditional tattoo", "Neo traditional tattoo": "Neo traditional tattoo", "tag:large": "Backpieces", "tag:classics": "Classics", "tag:early": "Vroeg werk", "tag:a-bat": "Vleermuis", "tag:a-bear": "Beer", "tag:a-bee": "Bij", "tag:a-bird": "Vogel", "tag:a-butterfly": "Vlinder", "tag:a-cat": "Kat", "tag:a-dog": "Hond", "tag:a-dragon": "Draak", "tag:a-eagle": "Arend", "tag:a-horse": "Paard", "tag:a-koi-fish": "Koi", "tag:a-lion": "Leeuw", "tag:a-moth": "Mot", "tag:a-owl": "Uil", "tag:a-panther": "Panter", "tag:a-rooster": "Haan", "tag:a-scorpion": "Schorpioen", "tag:a-shark": "Haai", "tag:a-snake": "Slang", "tag:a-spider": "Spin", "tag:a-swallow": "Zwaluw", "tag:a-tiger": "Tijger", "tag:a-wolf": "Wolf", "tag:tmu5fu1v0": "Recent werk", "tag:tmu5fyc52": "Nautisch", "tag:tmu5fyndd": "Dames & gezichten", "tag:tmu5fytv8": "Planten & bloemen", "tag:tmu5fyyyj": "Schedels", "tag:tmu5fz3um": "Objecten", "tag:tmu5fzg7s": "Harten & liefde", "tag:tmu5g45hx": "Dolken & wapens", "tag:a-tmu5g52de": "Insecten", "tag:tmu5g6u6t": "Creatief", "tag:tmu5ga1to": "Figuren & ambachten", "tag:tmu5gbxa1": "Borststukken", "tag:a-tmu5gox7m": "Walvis", "tag:l-back": "Rug", "tag:l-arm": "Arm", "tag:l-lower-arm": "Onderarm", "tag:l-leg": "Been", "tag:l-front": "Voorkant", "tag:a-crocodile": "Krokodil", "tag:a-insect": "Insect", "tag:c-color": "Kleur", "tag:c-bg": "Zwart & grijs", "tag:s-psychedelic": "Psychedelisch", "tag:s-surreal": "Surrealistisch", "tag:s-fillers": "Fillers", "tag:s-railway": "Spoorweg", "tag:s-flash": "Flash", "tag:s-modern": "Modern", "tag:s-nature": "Natuur", "Modern &amp; aesthetic traditional tattoo artist based in Antwerp, working from a private studio by appointment. Rooted in traditional western tattooing, adding a bit of new imagery and creativity. Classic and bold, to withstand time, fading and trendyness. Working from flash and happy to create custom pieces.": "Moderne &amp; esthetische traditional tattoo artist in Antwerpen, werkend vanuit een privéstudio op afspraak. Geworteld in het traditionele westerse tatoeëren, aangevuld met nieuwe beelden en creativiteit. Klassiek en bold, bestand tegen de tijd, vervaging en trends. Ik werk vanuit flash en maak met plezier custom ontwerpen.", "10+ years": "10+ jaar", "of experience": "ervaring", "Instagram": "Instagram", "Clean lines, solid colour and strong contrasts. Careful placement, and work that stays readable for many years.": "Strakke lijnen, volle kleur en sterke contrasten. Zorgvuldige plaatsing, en werk dat nog jaren leesbaar blijft.", "Pick a free slot for your tattoo and tell me what you have in mind. Rather drop by first to talk it through? Just mention which mornings at 9 or 10 suit you. Nothing that suits — evenings, or my days off? Send the request anyway, or email me, and we'll find a moment together. Every request is confirmed by me personally, by email.": "Kies een vrij moment voor je tattoo en vertel me wat je in gedachten hebt. Liever eerst even langskomen om het te bespreken? Zet er dan bij welke ochtenden om 9 of 10 uur je passen. Past er niets — ’s avonds, of op mijn vrije dagen? Verstuur de aanvraag toch, of mail me, dan vinden we samen een moment. Elke aanvraag bevestig ik persoonlijk, per e-mail.", "<strong>Pick a slot &amp; send your idea</strong>Choose how much time you'll need, a free day and a time. Add your general idea, placement, black or color and reference pictures. The slot is held for you while I have a look.": "<strong>Kies een moment &amp; stuur je idee</strong>Kies hoeveel tijd je nodig hebt, een vrije dag en een uur. Voeg je algemene idee, plaatsing, zwart of kleur en referentiebeelden toe. Het moment wordt voor je vastgehouden terwijl ik ernaar kijk.", "<strong>I confirm by email</strong>I check your idea and confirm your slot — or suggest a different day or duration if the piece needs it. With enough information I can give you an estimated price. Nothing is final before my confirmation; once confirmed, I may ask you to pay a €50 deposit.": "<strong>Ik bevestig per e-mail</strong>Ik bekijk je idee en bevestig je moment — of stel een andere dag of duur voor als de tattoo dat vraagt. Met genoeg informatie kan ik een richtprijs geven. Niets is definitief vóór mijn bevestiging; daarna kan ik een voorschot van €50 vragen.", "<strong>We fine-tune the design together</strong>I can sketch in advance and send it the week before for feedback, or draw it out on the appointment. Together we make the final drawing, keeping details to size and placement in mind. There are a lot of line drawings ready to go as well. Then: one client at a time, in a calm private studio.": "<strong>We verfijnen het ontwerp samen</strong>Ik kan op voorhand schetsen en het de week ervoor doorsturen voor feedback, of het uittekenen tijdens de afspraak. Samen maken we de definitieve tekening, met details afgestemd op formaat en plaatsing. Er liggen ook heel wat lijntekeningen klaar. En dan: één klant tegelijk, in een rustige privéstudio.", "How much time do you need?": "Hoeveel tijd heb je nodig?", "Pick how much time you need and, if you can, a free day and time. Then tell me your idea — I confirm by email.": "Kies hoeveel tijd je nodig hebt en, als het kan, een vrije dag en uur. Vertel me dan je idee — ik bevestig per e-mail.", "If you want to discuss your project, let me know which mornings at 9 or 10 you can come to the studio.": "Wil je je project bespreken? Laat me weten welke ochtenden om 9 of 10 uur je naar de studio kunt komen.", "You'll get a confirmation by email — nothing is final until then.": "Je krijgt een bevestiging per e-mail — tot dan is niets definitief.", "Keep in mind: good aftercare is part of a good end result.": "Onthoud: goede nazorg is deel van een goed eindresultaat.", "Come by": "Kom langs", "more": "meer", "less": "minder", "Style": "Stijl", "tag:y-modern": "Modern traditional tattoo", "tag:y-american": "American traditional tattoo", "tag:y-western": "Western traditional tattoo", "tag:y-neo": "Neo traditional tattoo", "tagl:daggers": "Dolken", "tagl:dagger": "Dolk", "tagl:custom": "Custom", "tagl:back piece": "Backpiece", "tagl:objects": "Objecten", "tagl:classics": "Classics", "tagl:flash": "Flash", "tagl:fillers": "Fillers", "Choose how much time you need": "Kies hoeveel tijd je nodig hebt", "Close": "Sluiten", "Filter tattoos by category": "Filter tattoos per categorie", "Language": "Taal", "Main": "Hoofdmenu", "Next": "Volgende", "Previous": "Vorige", "Tattoo enlarged": "Tattoo vergroot", "What to expect": "Wat je mag verwachten", "Switch between dark and light": "Wissel tussen donker en licht", "Switch to light": "Naar licht", "Switch to dark": "Naar donker"};
I18N.fr={"Website by": "Site web par", "Privacy": "Confidentialité", "Terms": "Conditions", "By sending your request you agree to the": "En envoyant votre demande, vous acceptez les", "terms": "conditions générales", "and the": "et la", "privacy policy": "politique de confidentialité", "Tattoos": "Tatouages", "About": "À propos", "Booking": "Réservation", "Healing": "Cicatrisation", "Shop": "Boutique", "Contact": "Contact", "Book now": "Réserver", "Traditional tattoo artist · Antwerp": "Tatoueur traditionnel · Anvers", "Powerful.<br>Timeless.<br><span>Personal.</span>": "Puissant.<br>Intemporel.<br><span>Personnel.</span>", "Modern &amp; aesthetic traditional tattoo artist based in Antwerp, working from a private studio by appointment. Rooted in traditional western tattooing, adding a bit of new imagery and creativity. Classic and bold, to withstand time, fading and trendyness.": "Tatoueur traditionnel moderne &amp; esthétique basé à Anvers, travaillant dans un studio privé sur rendez-vous. Ancré dans le tatouage traditionnel occidental, avec une touche d’imagerie nouvelle et de créativité. Classique et bold, pour résister au temps, à la décoloration et aux modes.", "Working from flash and happy to create custom pieces.": "Je travaille à partir de flashs et crée volontiers des pièces sur mesure.", "Book an appointment": "Prendre rendez-vous", "See the work": "Voir le travail", "years of experience": "ans d’expérience", "One-on-one": "En tête-à-tête", "private studio": "studio privé", "Antwerp · by appointment": "Anvers · sur rendez-vous", "Latest work on Instagram": "Derniers travaux sur Instagram", "The work": "Le travail", "Clean lines, solid colour and strong contrasts. Careful placement, and work that stays readable for many years. Click a piece to see it large, click a tag to filter.": "Lignes nettes, couleurs pleines et contrastes forts. Un placement soigné et un travail qui reste lisible pendant des années. Cliquez sur une pièce pour l’agrandir, sur un tag pour filtrer.", "Who I am": "Qui je suis", "I'm Tobias.": "Je suis Tobias.", "A tattoo artist with more than 10 years of experience, and a creative background that started long before I entered the tattoo world.": "Un tatoueur avec plus de 10 ans d’expérience, et un parcours créatif qui a commencé bien avant mon entrée dans le monde du tatouage.", "I have been drawing my entire life, from art classes as a child to painting courses and a long graffiti history. It all shaped my sense of line, rhythm and contrast.": "Je dessine depuis toujours : cours d’art enfant, cours de peinture et une longue histoire de graffiti. Tout cela a façonné mon sens de la ligne, du rythme et du contraste.", "As an adult, I founded the graphic design studio <a href=\"https://afreux.be/web/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">afreux.be</a> with two friends. We worked in music, the cultural sector, NGOs and personal artistic projects. My years in design taught me to think in composition, balance, typography and visual clarity. These elements now flow naturally into my tattoo work.": "Adulte, j’ai fondé le studio graphique <a href=\"https://afreux.be/web/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">afreux.be</a> avec deux amis. Nous avons travaillé pour la musique, le secteur culturel, des ONG et des projets artistiques personnels. Mes années de design m’ont appris à penser en composition, équilibre, typographie et clarté visuelle. Ces éléments coulent aujourd’hui naturellement dans mes tatouages.", "I started tattooing under the wings of Tomas Redrey and Younes at Brabo's Hand, came as a guest to Nuit Noire Tattoo, Purple Sun and Papanatos, and as a regular at True Blue Tattoo. Also events like Us By Night, Brussels Tattoo Convention, True Blue Convention, True Love Convention, etc.": "J’ai commencé à tatouer sous l’aile de Tomas Redrey et Younes chez Brabo’s Hand, j’ai été guest chez Nuit Noire Tattoo, Purple Sun et Papanatos, et résident chez True Blue Tattoo. Sans oublier des événements comme Us By Night, Brussels Tattoo Convention, True Blue Convention, True Love Convention, etc.", "My style": "Mon style", "Timeless, bold &amp; designed for the body": "Intemporel, bold &amp; conçu pour le corps", "I work within classic Western and American Traditional tattooing and combine this with a modern, graphic approach. A traditional base, on which a layer of personal influence and style is added. More modern imagery, objects and influences are mixed into the subtle outcome. I consciously remain very loyal stylewise through time — away from trends and fashion.": "Je travaille dans le tatouage traditionnel classique, occidental et américain, et le combine avec une approche moderne et graphique. Une base traditionnelle, sur laquelle vient une couche d’influence et de style personnels. Des images, objets et influences plus modernes s’y mêlent subtilement. Je reste volontairement très fidèle à mon style au fil du temps — loin des tendances et de la mode.", "Clean lines": "Lignes nettes", "Solid colour": "Couleurs pleines", "Strong contrasts": "Contrastes forts", "Long-term readability": "Lisibilité à long terme", "Careful placement": "Placement soigné", "I always design with the healing process in mind. Lines and shapes are chosen because they hold up well on the skin, both today and many years from now. The pigments and my colour palette are chosen through years of experience to stay saturated and bright.": "Je conçois toujours en pensant à la cicatrisation. Les lignes et les formes sont choisies parce qu’elles tiennent bien sur la peau, aujourd’hui comme dans de nombreuses années. Les pigments et ma palette de couleurs ont été choisis, avec des années d’expérience, pour rester saturés et lumineux.", "I do not follow fast-fading trends. I focus on craftsmanship that lasts. Placement — for both now and future plans — is always carefully taken into account, as well as making my work blend with that of other artists.": "Je ne suis pas les tendances éphémères. Je mise sur un savoir-faire qui dure. Le placement — pour maintenant comme pour vos projets futurs — est toujours soigneusement pris en compte, tout comme l’harmonie de mon travail avec celui d’autres artistes.", "How I work": "Ma façon de travailler", "Honest, focused &amp; one-on-one": "Honnête, concentré &amp; en tête-à-tête", "In my private studio, I work with one client at a time. This gives us time to talk through your idea and space to refine it. I share the space and approach with Warren Moris, who's always open for input.": "Dans mon studio privé, je travaille avec un seul client à la fois. Cela nous laisse le temps de parler de votre idée et l’espace pour l’affiner. Je partage l’espace et l’approche avec Warren Moris, toujours ouvert aux suggestions.", "You can expect a calm and professional atmosphere, honest advice and clear communication without sales talk.": "Attendez-vous à une atmosphère calme et professionnelle, des conseils honnêtes et une communication claire, sans discours commercial.", "I see a tattoo as a collaboration. It is your idea combined with my experience, and we work together in a direct and open way. If it doesn't feel right, both me and the client can agree not to go further — luckily that rarely happens.": "Je vois un tatouage comme une collaboration : votre idée combinée à mon expérience, dans un échange direct et ouvert. Si ça ne le sent pas, le client comme moi pouvons décider de ne pas aller plus loin — heureusement, c’est rare.", "Why clients choose Tattoo Tobias": "Pourquoi les clients choisissent Tattoo Tobias", "What you can count on.": "Ce sur quoi vous pouvez compter.", "A combination of craftsmanship and graphic design, resulting in clear and strong artwork.": "Une combinaison de savoir-faire et de design graphique, pour un résultat clair et fort.", "A quiet private studio with full focus and no distractions — safe and respectful for all.": "Un studio privé et calme, pleinement concentré et sans distractions — sûr et respectueux pour tous.", "Honest and direct communication, so you always know what works and what does not.": "Une communication honnête et directe, pour toujours savoir ce qui fonctionne et ce qui ne fonctionne pas.", "Rooted in classic Western tattooing, refined for today.": "Ancré dans le tatouage occidental classique, affiné pour aujourd’hui.", "Solid experience in traditional tattooing with a strong focus on healing and long-term readability.": "Une solide expérience du tatouage traditionnel, avec un accent fort sur la cicatrisation et la lisibilité à long terme.", "An artistic yet personal approach, with genuine care for every client.": "Une approche artistique et personnelle, avec une attention sincère pour chaque client.", "Reviews": "Avis", "What clients say": "Ce que disent les clients", "Read all reviews on Google": "Lire tous les avis sur Google", "Thanks a lot for showing interest in my work! Pick a free slot right here and tell me what you have in mind. Nothing that suits you — evenings, or my days off? Fill in the rest anyway, or send an email, and we'll find a moment together.": "Merci beaucoup pour l’intérêt que vous portez à mon travail ! Choisissez un créneau libre ici et dites-moi ce que vous avez en tête. Rien ne vous convient — le soir, ou mes jours de congé ? Remplissez quand même le reste, ou envoyez un e-mail, et nous trouverons un moment ensemble.", "<strong>Pick a slot &amp; send your idea</strong>Choose how much time you'll need, a free day and a time. Add your general idea, placement, black or color and reference pictures. The slot is held for you straight away.": "<strong>Choisissez un créneau &amp; envoyez votre idée</strong>Choisissez le temps nécessaire, un jour libre et une heure. Ajoutez votre idée générale, le placement, noir ou couleur et des images de référence. Le créneau est bloqué pour vous immédiatement.", "<strong>We fine-tune the design together</strong>I can sketch in advance and send it the week before for feedback, or draw it out on the appointment. Together we make the final drawing, keeping details to size and placement in mind. There are a lot of line drawings ready to go as well.": "<strong>Nous affinons le dessin ensemble</strong>Je peux dessiner à l’avance et l’envoyer la semaine précédente pour vos retours, ou le dessiner lors du rendez-vous. Ensemble, nous réalisons le dessin final, en adaptant les détails à la taille et au placement. Beaucoup de dessins au trait sont aussi prêts à l’emploi.", "<strong>I confirm</strong>I check your idea and confirm your slot by email — or suggest a different day or duration if the piece needs it. I can give you an estimated price if I have enough information. Once confirmed, I may ask you to pay a €50 deposit.": "<strong>Je confirme</strong>Je vérifie votre idée et confirme votre créneau par e-mail — ou propose un autre jour ou une autre durée si la pièce le demande. Avec assez d’informations, je peux vous donner un prix estimatif. Une fois confirmé, je peux vous demander un acompte de 50 €.", "<strong>Tattoo day</strong>One client at a time, in a calm private studio. A piece you can wear with pride.": "<strong>Le jour du tatouage</strong>Un client à la fois, dans un studio privé et calme. Une pièce à porter avec fierté.", "Consultation or browsing flash": "Consultation ou choix d’un flash", "Touch-up or a small tattoo": "Retouche ou petit tatouage", "Palm- and hand-size tattoos": "Tatouages de la taille d’une paume ou d’une main", "Fronts, backs, multiple tattoos, back pieces, day sessions": "Torse, dos, plusieurs tatouages, back pieces, sessions d’une journée", "<strong>Tip:</strong> give me your phone number for any short-notice communication.": "<strong>Conseil :</strong> laissez-moi votre numéro de téléphone pour toute communication de dernière minute.", "<strong>Tip:</strong> stick to the email conversation. Using different channels for a single project creates confusion and errors.": "<strong>Conseil :</strong> restez dans la conversation par e-mail. Utiliser plusieurs canaux pour un même projet crée confusion et erreurs.", "Request an appointment": "Demander un rendez-vous", "Choose how much time you'll need, pick a free day and time if you can, and tell me your idea. I confirm personally.": "Choisissez le temps nécessaire, un jour et une heure libres si possible, et dites-moi votre idée. Je confirme personnellement.", "Required. Everything else helps me prepare, but is optional.": "Obligatoire. Le reste m’aide à préparer, mais est facultatif.", "1 · How much time?": "1 · Combien de temps ?", "2 · Which day?": "2 · Quel jour ?", "optional": "facultatif", "3 · What time?": "3 · À quelle heure ?", "Name": "Nom", "Email": "E-mail", "Phone number": "Numéro de téléphone", "Your general idea": "Votre idée générale", "Placement": "Placement", "Approximate size": "Taille approximative", "Black or color": "Noir ou couleur", "Not sure yet": "Pas encore sûr", "Black": "Noir", "Color": "Couleur", "Reference material": "Références", "Add reference photos": "Ajouter des photos de référence", "drag them here or tap to choose · up to 8 photos": "glissez-les ici ou touchez pour choisir · jusqu’à 8 photos", "Is the tattoo going between existing ones? Please add a photo of the spot.": "Le tatouage vient-il entre des tatouages existants ? Ajoutez une photo de l’endroit.", "Send my request": "Envoyer ma demande", "Prefer email?": "Vous préférez l’e-mail ?", "Request sent": "Demande envoyée", "Tobias checks your idea and confirms by email, or suggests another time if the tattoo needs a different slot. You may be asked to pay a €50 deposit to make it final.": "Tobias vérifie votre idée et confirme par e-mail, ou propose un autre moment si le tatouage demande un autre créneau. Un acompte de 50 € peut vous être demandé pour finaliser.", "Send another request": "Envoyer une autre demande", "Aftercare": "Soins après tatouage", "Keep in mind: good aftercare is part of a good end result. Four phases, a few do's and don'ts.": "N’oubliez pas : de bons soins font partie d’un bon résultat final. Quatre phases, quelques choses à faire et à éviter.", "First hours": "Premières heures", "Foil &amp; first wash": "Film &amp; premier lavage", "Keep the foil for at least three hours or overnight. Wash your hands with soap before handling your new tattoo.": "Gardez le film au moins trois heures ou toute la nuit. Lavez-vous les mains au savon avant de toucher votre nouveau tatouage.", "Remove the foil and wash the tattoo carefully with your hands to remove all surface blood, sweat and ink. To avoid irritation from the tape, remove the foil after a few minutes of showering.": "Retirez le film et lavez soigneusement le tatouage avec les mains pour enlever le sang, la sueur et l’encre en surface. Pour éviter l’irritation due à l’adhésif, retirez le film après quelques minutes sous la douche.", "Clean with just water — pH-neutral soap can be used, but no normal soap. Rinse, then let it dry in open air or pat dry with a clean towel.": "Nettoyez à l’eau seule — un savon au pH neutre est possible, mais pas de savon ordinaire. Rincez, puis laissez sécher à l’air libre ou tamponnez avec une serviette propre.", "Day 1 – 14": "Jour 1 – 14", "Thin layer of cream": "Fine couche de crème", "We advise Cicaplast B5 or Easy Tattoo. Always apply a thin layer of ointment, 3 to 6 times a day for at least 14 days to maintain hydration.": "Nous conseillons Cicaplast B5 ou Easy Tattoo. Appliquez toujours une fine couche de pommade, 3 à 6 fois par jour pendant au moins 14 jours pour maintenir l’hydratation.", "It helps the tattoo settle nicely if you keep going for an extra 2 weeks.": "Continuer 2 semaines de plus aide le tatouage à bien se fixer.", "You may refilm for two nights to avoid stains in your bed — also if you have a dirty job. Keep your tattoo open for the rest of the time.": "Vous pouvez remettre un film pendant deux nuits pour éviter les taches dans le lit — aussi si vous faites un travail salissant. Laissez votre tatouage à l’air le reste du temps.", "Day 3 – 7 and on": "Jour 3 – 7 et après", "Peeling &amp; scabbing": "Desquamation &amp; croûtes", "The tattoo may start to peel and scab. Don't pick or peel the skin away — let it fall off naturally during washing or applying cream. Fresh skin will soon replace the dead skin.": "Le tatouage peut commencer à peler et à former des croûtes. Ne grattez pas et n’arrachez pas la peau — laissez-la tomber naturellement lors du lavage ou de l’application de crème. Une peau neuve remplacera vite la peau morte.", "The ink may fade during the process, but will return when healing is completed. Too dry skin will crust and push ink out. With a real crust, increase cream frequency — but always apply slightly: too much prevents the skin from breathing.": "L’encre peut paraître plus pâle pendant le processus, mais revient une fois la cicatrisation terminée. Une peau trop sèche forme des croûtes et repousse l’encre. En cas de vraie croûte, appliquez la crème plus souvent — mais toujours en fine couche : trop empêche la peau de respirer.", "After a few months": "Après quelques mois", "Sun": "Soleil", "After a few months you may sunbathe in moderation.": "Après quelques mois, vous pouvez prendre le soleil avec modération.", "Use sun cream, factor 50, to prevent early fading. Exposure to the sun is the major cause of tattoo fading.": "Utilisez une crème solaire indice 50 pour éviter une décoloration précoce. L’exposition au soleil est la principale cause de décoloration des tatouages.", "Do": "À faire", "Change your bed sheets if you have pets entering the bedroom.": "Changez vos draps si des animaux entrent dans la chambre.", "Continue applying cream as long as the tattoo feels sensitive.": "Continuez la crème tant que le tatouage reste sensible.", "Keep in mind good aftercare is part of a good end result!": "N’oubliez pas : de bons soins font partie d’un bon résultat final !", "Get in touch if your tattoo needs a touch-up.": "Contactez-moi si votre tatouage a besoin d’une retouche.", "Get in touch if you're worried about the healing process or have an infection.": "Contactez-moi si la cicatrisation vous inquiète ou en cas d’infection.", "Don't": "À éviter", "Apply Vaseline or petroleum-based products.": "Appliquer de la vaseline ou des produits à base de pétrole.", "Apply alcohol.": "Appliquer de l’alcool.", "Rub, scratch or pick at the tattoo.": "Frotter, gratter ou toucher les croûtes.", "Expose the tattoo to direct sunlight.": "Exposer le tatouage au soleil direct.", "Swim — no sauna, no steam bath or bathtub for 3 to 4 weeks.": "Nager — pas de sauna, de hammam ni de bain pendant 3 à 4 semaines.", "Happy <span>healing!</span>": "Happy <span>healing!</span>", "The shop": "La boutique", "Prints and goods by Tobias De Bruyn, available in the online shop.": "Prints et objets de Tobias De Bruyn, disponibles dans la boutique en ligne.", "Visit the shop ↗": "Visiter la boutique ↗", "Come by — by appointment": "Passez — sur rendez-vous", "<a href=\"#booking\">Use the booking form</a> — pick a free slot and send your idea": "<a href=\"#booking\">Utilisez le formulaire de réservation</a> — choisissez un créneau libre et envoyez votre idée", "Email · for info and booking": "E-mail · pour infos et réservations", "Tattoo studio": "Studio de tatouage", "Opening": "Horaires", "Private studio · only by appointment": "Studio privé · uniquement sur rendez-vous", "Route via Google Maps": "Itinéraire via Google Maps", "Photography by Jannis Bachard": "Photographie : Jannis Bachard", "e.g. A panther head on my forearm, black. Or: I'd like to drop by first to discuss my project — which mornings at 9 or 10 suit you? Or ask for a different time slot.": "p. ex. Une tête de panthère sur l’avant-bras, en noir. Ou : j’aimerais d’abord passer pour discuter de mon projet — quels matins à 9 h ou 10 h vous conviennent ? Ou demandez un autre créneau.", "e.g. upper arm": "p. ex. haut du bras", "e.g. 15 cm": "p. ex. 15 cm", "All work": "Tout le travail", "Animals": "Animaux", "Colour": "Couleur", "Show more": "Afficher plus", "Enlarge": "Agrandir", "Consultation": "Consultation", "Small": "Petit", "Medium": "Moyen", "Full day": "Journée complète", "Discuss your project or browse flash": "Discuter de votre projet ou choisir un flash", "hour": "heure", "hours": "heures", "Previous month": "Mois précédent", "Next month": "Mois suivant", "Mo,Tu,We,Th,Fr,Sa,Su": "Lu,Ma,Me,Je,Ve,Sa,Di", "Choose how much time you need first — the free days then light up.": "Choisissez d’abord le temps nécessaire — les jours libres s’allument ensuite.", "Choose a day first — or skip this and just send your request.": "Choisissez d’abord un jour — ou passez cette étape et envoyez simplement votre demande.", "held for you as soon as you send": "bloqué pour vous dès l’envoi", "Pick a start time, or unselect the day.": "Choisissez une heure de début, ou désélectionnez le jour.", "your name": "votre nom", "a valid email address": "une adresse e-mail valide", "your phone number": "votre numéro de téléphone", "your idea": "votre idée", "Please fill in": "Veuillez indiquer :", "Sending…": "Envoi…", "is held for you.": "est bloqué pour vous.", "No slot chosen — I'll get back to you by email with a proposal for a date.": "Aucun créneau choisi — je vous recontacte par e-mail avec une proposition de date.", "Sorry, that time was just taken. Please pick another one.": "Désolé, ce créneau vient d’être pris. Choisissez-en un autre.", "Something went wrong while sending. Please try again, or email me directly.": "Une erreur s’est produite lors de l’envoi. Réessayez, ou écrivez-moi directement.", "No slot chosen": "Aucun créneau choisi", "Modern traditional tattoo": "Tatouage traditionnel moderne", "American traditional tattoo": "Tatouage traditionnel américain", "Western traditional tattoo": "Tatouage traditionnel occidental", "Neo traditional tattoo": "Tatouage néo-traditionnel", "tag:large": "Back pieces", "tag:classics": "Classiques", "tag:early": "Débuts", "tag:a-bat": "Chauve-souris", "tag:a-bear": "Ours", "tag:a-bee": "Abeille", "tag:a-bird": "Oiseau", "tag:a-butterfly": "Papillon", "tag:a-cat": "Chat", "tag:a-dog": "Chien", "tag:a-dragon": "Dragon", "tag:a-eagle": "Aigle", "tag:a-horse": "Cheval", "tag:a-koi-fish": "Carpe koï", "tag:a-lion": "Lion", "tag:a-moth": "Papillon de nuit", "tag:a-owl": "Hibou", "tag:a-panther": "Panthère", "tag:a-rooster": "Coq", "tag:a-scorpion": "Scorpion", "tag:a-shark": "Requin", "tag:a-snake": "Serpent", "tag:a-spider": "Araignée", "tag:a-swallow": "Hirondelle", "tag:a-tiger": "Tigre", "tag:a-wolf": "Loup", "tag:tmu5fu1v0": "Derniers travaux", "tag:tmu5fyc52": "Nautique", "tag:tmu5fyndd": "Femmes & visages", "tag:tmu5fytv8": "Plantes & fleurs", "tag:tmu5fyyyj": "Crânes", "tag:tmu5fz3um": "Objets", "tag:tmu5fzg7s": "Cœurs & amour", "tag:tmu5g45hx": "Dagues & armes", "tag:a-tmu5g52de": "Insectes", "tag:tmu5g6u6t": "Créatif", "tag:tmu5ga1to": "Personnages & métiers", "tag:tmu5gbxa1": "Pièces de torse", "tag:a-tmu5gox7m": "Baleine", "tag:l-back": "Dos", "tag:l-arm": "Bras", "tag:l-lower-arm": "Avant-bras", "tag:l-leg": "Jambe", "tag:l-front": "Torse", "tag:a-crocodile": "Crocodile", "tag:a-insect": "Insecte", "tag:c-color": "Couleur", "tag:c-bg": "Noir & gris", "tag:s-psychedelic": "Psychédélique", "tag:s-surreal": "Surréaliste", "tag:s-fillers": "Fillers", "tag:s-railway": "Chemin de fer", "tag:s-flash": "Flash", "tag:s-modern": "Moderne", "tag:s-nature": "Nature", "Modern &amp; aesthetic traditional tattoo artist based in Antwerp, working from a private studio by appointment. Rooted in traditional western tattooing, adding a bit of new imagery and creativity. Classic and bold, to withstand time, fading and trendyness. Working from flash and happy to create custom pieces.": "Tatoueur traditionnel moderne &amp; esthétique basé à Anvers, travaillant dans un studio privé sur rendez-vous. Ancré dans le tatouage traditionnel occidental, avec une touche d’imagerie nouvelle et de créativité. Classique et bold, pour résister au temps, à la décoloration et aux modes. Je travaille à partir de flashs et crée volontiers des pièces sur mesure.", "10+ years": "10+ ans", "of experience": "d’expérience", "Instagram": "Instagram", "Clean lines, solid colour and strong contrasts. Careful placement, and work that stays readable for many years.": "Lignes nettes, couleurs pleines et contrastes forts. Un placement soigné et un travail qui reste lisible pendant des années.", "Pick a free slot for your tattoo and tell me what you have in mind. Rather drop by first to talk it through? Just mention which mornings at 9 or 10 suit you. Nothing that suits — evenings, or my days off? Send the request anyway, or email me, and we'll find a moment together. Every request is confirmed by me personally, by email.": "Choisissez un créneau libre pour votre tatouage et dites-moi ce que vous avez en tête. Vous préférez passer d’abord pour en parler ? Indiquez simplement quels matins à 9 h ou 10 h vous conviennent. Rien ne convient — le soir, ou mes jours de congé ? Envoyez quand même la demande, ou écrivez-moi, et nous trouverons un moment ensemble. Je confirme chaque demande personnellement, par e-mail.", "<strong>Pick a slot &amp; send your idea</strong>Choose how much time you'll need, a free day and a time. Add your general idea, placement, black or color and reference pictures. The slot is held for you while I have a look.": "<strong>Choisissez un créneau &amp; envoyez votre idée</strong>Choisissez le temps nécessaire, un jour libre et une heure. Ajoutez votre idée générale, le placement, noir ou couleur et des images de référence. Le créneau est bloqué pour vous le temps que je regarde.", "<strong>I confirm by email</strong>I check your idea and confirm your slot — or suggest a different day or duration if the piece needs it. With enough information I can give you an estimated price. Nothing is final before my confirmation; once confirmed, I may ask you to pay a €50 deposit.": "<strong>Je confirme par e-mail</strong>Je vérifie votre idée et confirme votre créneau — ou propose un autre jour ou une autre durée si la pièce le demande. Avec assez d’informations, je peux vous donner un prix estimatif. Rien n’est définitif avant ma confirmation ; ensuite, je peux vous demander un acompte de 50 €.", "<strong>We fine-tune the design together</strong>I can sketch in advance and send it the week before for feedback, or draw it out on the appointment. Together we make the final drawing, keeping details to size and placement in mind. There are a lot of line drawings ready to go as well. Then: one client at a time, in a calm private studio.": "<strong>Nous affinons le dessin ensemble</strong>Je peux dessiner à l’avance et l’envoyer la semaine précédente pour vos retours, ou le dessiner lors du rendez-vous. Ensemble, nous réalisons le dessin final, en adaptant les détails à la taille et au placement. Beaucoup de dessins au trait sont aussi prêts à l’emploi. Ensuite : un client à la fois, dans un studio privé et calme.", "How much time do you need?": "De combien de temps avez-vous besoin ?", "Pick how much time you need and, if you can, a free day and time. Then tell me your idea — I confirm by email.": "Choisissez le temps nécessaire et, si possible, un jour et une heure libres. Puis dites-moi votre idée — je confirme par e-mail.", "If you want to discuss your project, let me know which mornings at 9 or 10 you can come to the studio.": "Si vous voulez discuter de votre projet, dites-moi quels matins à 9 h ou 10 h vous pouvez passer au studio.", "You'll get a confirmation by email — nothing is final until then.": "Vous recevrez une confirmation par e-mail — rien n’est définitif avant cela.", "Keep in mind: good aftercare is part of a good end result.": "N’oubliez pas : de bons soins font partie d’un bon résultat final.", "Come by": "Passez nous voir", "more": "plus", "less": "moins", "Style": "Style", "tag:y-modern": "Tatouage traditionnel moderne", "tag:y-american": "Tatouage traditionnel américain", "tag:y-western": "Tatouage traditionnel occidental", "tag:y-neo": "Tatouage néo-traditionnel", "tagl:daggers": "Dagues", "tagl:dagger": "Dague", "tagl:custom": "Sur mesure", "tagl:back piece": "Back piece", "tagl:objects": "Objets", "tagl:classics": "Classiques", "tagl:flash": "Flash", "tagl:fillers": "Fillers", "Choose how much time you need": "Choisissez le temps nécessaire", "Close": "Fermer", "Filter tattoos by category": "Filtrer les tatouages par catégorie", "Language": "Langue", "Main": "Menu principal", "Next": "Suivant", "Previous": "Précédent", "Tattoo enlarged": "Tatouage agrandi", "What to expect": "À quoi s’attendre", "Switch between dark and light": "Basculer entre sombre et clair", "Switch to light": "Passer en clair", "Switch to dark": "Passer en sombre"};
I18N.de={"Website by": "Website von", "Privacy": "Datenschutz", "Terms": "AGB", "By sending your request you agree to the": "Mit dem Absenden deiner Anfrage akzeptierst du die", "terms": "AGB", "and the": "und die", "privacy policy": "Datenschutzerklärung", "Tattoos": "Tattoos", "About": "Über mich", "Booking": "Termin", "Healing": "Nachsorge", "Shop": "Shop", "Contact": "Kontakt", "Book now": "Jetzt buchen", "Traditional tattoo artist · Antwerp": "Traditional Tattoo Artist · Antwerpen", "Powerful.<br>Timeless.<br><span>Personal.</span>": "Kraftvoll.<br>Zeitlos.<br><span>Persönlich.</span>", "Modern &amp; aesthetic traditional tattoo artist based in Antwerp, working from a private studio by appointment. Rooted in traditional western tattooing, adding a bit of new imagery and creativity. Classic and bold, to withstand time, fading and trendyness.": "Moderner &amp; ästhetischer Traditional Tattoo Artist in Antwerpen, der in einem privaten Studio nach Vereinbarung arbeitet. Verwurzelt im traditionellen westlichen Tätowieren, ergänzt um neue Bildsprache und Kreativität. Klassisch und bold – gemacht, um Zeit, Verblassen und Trends zu überstehen.", "Working from flash and happy to create custom pieces.": "Ich arbeite mit Flash und entwerfe gern individuelle Motive.", "Book an appointment": "Termin vereinbaren", "See the work": "Arbeiten ansehen", "years of experience": "Jahre Erfahrung", "One-on-one": "Eins zu eins", "private studio": "privates Studio", "Antwerp · by appointment": "Antwerpen · nach Vereinbarung", "Latest work on Instagram": "Aktuelle Arbeiten auf Instagram", "The work": "Die Arbeiten", "Clean lines, solid colour and strong contrasts. Careful placement, and work that stays readable for many years. Click a piece to see it large, click a tag to filter.": "Klare Linien, satte Farben und starke Kontraste. Sorgfältige Platzierung und Arbeiten, die viele Jahre lesbar bleiben. Klicke auf ein Motiv, um es groß zu sehen, und auf ein Tag, um zu filtern.", "Who I am": "Wer ich bin", "I'm Tobias.": "Ich bin Tobias.", "A tattoo artist with more than 10 years of experience, and a creative background that started long before I entered the tattoo world.": "Ein Tattoo Artist mit über 10 Jahren Erfahrung und einem kreativen Hintergrund, der lange vor meinem Einstieg in die Tattoo-Welt begann.", "I have been drawing my entire life, from art classes as a child to painting courses and a long graffiti history. It all shaped my sense of line, rhythm and contrast.": "Ich zeichne mein ganzes Leben lang – von Kunstkursen als Kind über Malkurse bis zu einer langen Graffiti-Geschichte. All das hat mein Gefühl für Linie, Rhythmus und Kontrast geprägt.", "As an adult, I founded the graphic design studio <a href=\"https://afreux.be/web/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">afreux.be</a> with two friends. We worked in music, the cultural sector, NGOs and personal artistic projects. My years in design taught me to think in composition, balance, typography and visual clarity. These elements now flow naturally into my tattoo work.": "Als Erwachsener gründete ich mit zwei Freunden das Grafikstudio <a href=\"https://afreux.be/web/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">afreux.be</a>. Wir arbeiteten für Musik, den Kultursektor, NGOs und persönliche Kunstprojekte. Meine Jahre im Design haben mich gelehrt, in Komposition, Balance, Typografie und visueller Klarheit zu denken. Diese Elemente fließen heute ganz natürlich in meine Tattoos ein.", "I started tattooing under the wings of Tomas Redrey and Younes at Brabo's Hand, came as a guest to Nuit Noire Tattoo, Purple Sun and Papanatos, and as a regular at True Blue Tattoo. Also events like Us By Night, Brussels Tattoo Convention, True Blue Convention, True Love Convention, etc.": "Mit dem Tätowieren begann ich unter den Fittichen von Tomas Redrey und Younes bei Brabo’s Hand, war Gast bei Nuit Noire Tattoo, Purple Sun und Papanatos und fester Artist bei True Blue Tattoo. Dazu Events wie Us By Night, Brussels Tattoo Convention, True Blue Convention, True Love Convention usw.", "My style": "Mein Stil", "Timeless, bold &amp; designed for the body": "Zeitlos, bold &amp; für den Körper entworfen", "I work within classic Western and American Traditional tattooing and combine this with a modern, graphic approach. A traditional base, on which a layer of personal influence and style is added. More modern imagery, objects and influences are mixed into the subtle outcome. I consciously remain very loyal stylewise through time — away from trends and fashion.": "Ich arbeite im klassischen Western und American Traditional Tattoo und verbinde das mit einem modernen, grafischen Ansatz. Eine traditionelle Basis, auf die eine Schicht persönlicher Einflüsse und Stil kommt. Modernere Bilder, Objekte und Einflüsse fließen subtil ins Ergebnis ein. Ich bleibe meinem Stil über die Jahre bewusst treu – fern von Trends und Mode.", "Clean lines": "Klare Linien", "Solid colour": "Satte Farben", "Strong contrasts": "Starke Kontraste", "Long-term readability": "Langfristige Lesbarkeit", "Careful placement": "Sorgfältige Platzierung", "I always design with the healing process in mind. Lines and shapes are chosen because they hold up well on the skin, both today and many years from now. The pigments and my colour palette are chosen through years of experience to stay saturated and bright.": "Ich entwerfe immer mit Blick auf den Heilungsprozess. Linien und Formen werden gewählt, weil sie auf der Haut gut halten – heute und in vielen Jahren. Die Pigmente und meine Farbpalette sind durch jahrelange Erfahrung so gewählt, dass sie satt und leuchtend bleiben.", "I do not follow fast-fading trends. I focus on craftsmanship that lasts. Placement — for both now and future plans — is always carefully taken into account, as well as making my work blend with that of other artists.": "Ich folge keinen schnell verblassenden Trends. Ich setze auf Handwerk, das bleibt. Die Platzierung – für jetzt und für künftige Pläne – wird immer sorgfältig bedacht, ebenso wie das Zusammenspiel meiner Arbeit mit der anderer Artists.", "How I work": "Wie ich arbeite", "Honest, focused &amp; one-on-one": "Ehrlich, fokussiert &amp; eins zu eins", "In my private studio, I work with one client at a time. This gives us time to talk through your idea and space to refine it. I share the space and approach with Warren Moris, who's always open for input.": "In meinem privaten Studio arbeite ich mit einem Kunden nach dem anderen. So bleibt Zeit, deine Idee zu besprechen, und Raum, sie zu verfeinern. Ich teile Studio und Ansatz mit Warren Moris, der immer offen für Input ist.", "You can expect a calm and professional atmosphere, honest advice and clear communication without sales talk.": "Dich erwarten eine ruhige, professionelle Atmosphäre, ehrliche Beratung und klare Kommunikation ohne Verkaufsgerede.", "I see a tattoo as a collaboration. It is your idea combined with my experience, and we work together in a direct and open way. If it doesn't feel right, both me and the client can agree not to go further — luckily that rarely happens.": "Ein Tattoo ist für mich Zusammenarbeit: deine Idee kombiniert mit meiner Erfahrung, direkt und offen. Wenn es sich nicht richtig anfühlt, können sowohl ich als auch der Kunde entscheiden, nicht weiterzugehen – zum Glück kommt das selten vor.", "Why clients choose Tattoo Tobias": "Warum Kunden Tattoo Tobias wählen", "What you can count on.": "Worauf du dich verlassen kannst.", "A combination of craftsmanship and graphic design, resulting in clear and strong artwork.": "Eine Kombination aus Handwerk und Grafikdesign, die klare und starke Motive ergibt.", "A quiet private studio with full focus and no distractions — safe and respectful for all.": "Ein ruhiges privates Studio mit voller Konzentration und ohne Ablenkung – sicher und respektvoll für alle.", "Honest and direct communication, so you always know what works and what does not.": "Ehrliche und direkte Kommunikation, damit du immer weißt, was funktioniert und was nicht.", "Rooted in classic Western tattooing, refined for today.": "Verwurzelt im klassischen westlichen Tätowieren, verfeinert für heute.", "Solid experience in traditional tattooing with a strong focus on healing and long-term readability.": "Solide Erfahrung im Traditional Tattoo mit starkem Fokus auf Heilung und langfristige Lesbarkeit.", "An artistic yet personal approach, with genuine care for every client.": "Ein künstlerischer und zugleich persönlicher Ansatz, mit echter Sorgfalt für jeden Kunden.", "Reviews": "Bewertungen", "What clients say": "Was Kunden sagen", "Read all reviews on Google": "Alle Bewertungen auf Google lesen", "Thanks a lot for showing interest in my work! Pick a free slot right here and tell me what you have in mind. Nothing that suits you — evenings, or my days off? Fill in the rest anyway, or send an email, and we'll find a moment together.": "Vielen Dank für dein Interesse an meiner Arbeit! Wähle hier einen freien Termin und erzähl mir, was du dir vorstellst. Passt nichts – abends, oder an meinen freien Tagen? Fülle den Rest trotzdem aus oder schreib eine E-Mail, dann finden wir gemeinsam einen Moment.", "<strong>Pick a slot &amp; send your idea</strong>Choose how much time you'll need, a free day and a time. Add your general idea, placement, black or color and reference pictures. The slot is held for you straight away.": "<strong>Termin wählen &amp; Idee senden</strong>Wähle, wie viel Zeit du brauchst, einen freien Tag und eine Uhrzeit. Ergänze deine grobe Idee, Platzierung, Schwarz oder Farbe und Referenzbilder. Der Termin wird sofort für dich reserviert.", "<strong>We fine-tune the design together</strong>I can sketch in advance and send it the week before for feedback, or draw it out on the appointment. Together we make the final drawing, keeping details to size and placement in mind. There are a lot of line drawings ready to go as well.": "<strong>Wir feilen gemeinsam am Entwurf</strong>Ich kann vorab skizzieren und den Entwurf in der Woche davor zum Feedback schicken, oder ihn beim Termin ausarbeiten. Gemeinsam machen wir die endgültige Zeichnung, mit Details passend zu Größe und Platzierung. Es liegen auch viele fertige Linienzeichnungen bereit.", "<strong>I confirm</strong>I check your idea and confirm your slot by email — or suggest a different day or duration if the piece needs it. I can give you an estimated price if I have enough information. Once confirmed, I may ask you to pay a €50 deposit.": "<strong>Ich bestätige</strong>Ich prüfe deine Idee und bestätige den Termin per E-Mail – oder schlage einen anderen Tag oder eine andere Dauer vor, wenn das Motiv es braucht. Mit genug Informationen kann ich einen Richtpreis nennen. Nach der Bestätigung bitte ich eventuell um eine Anzahlung von 50 €.", "<strong>Tattoo day</strong>One client at a time, in a calm private studio. A piece you can wear with pride.": "<strong>Tattoo-Tag</strong>Ein Kunde nach dem anderen, in einem ruhigen privaten Studio. Ein Motiv, das du mit Stolz trägst.", "Consultation or browsing flash": "Beratung oder Flash ansehen", "Touch-up or a small tattoo": "Nachstechen oder ein kleines Tattoo", "Palm- and hand-size tattoos": "Tattoos in Handteller- bis Handgröße", "Fronts, backs, multiple tattoos, back pieces, day sessions": "Brust, Rücken, mehrere Tattoos, Backpieces, Tagessessions", "<strong>Tip:</strong> give me your phone number for any short-notice communication.": "<strong>Tipp:</strong> gib mir deine Telefonnummer für kurzfristige Absprachen.", "<strong>Tip:</strong> stick to the email conversation. Using different channels for a single project creates confusion and errors.": "<strong>Tipp:</strong> bleib bei der E-Mail-Konversation. Verschiedene Kanäle für ein Projekt führen zu Verwirrung und Fehlern.", "Request an appointment": "Termin anfragen", "Choose how much time you'll need, pick a free day and time if you can, and tell me your idea. I confirm personally.": "Wähle, wie viel Zeit du brauchst, wenn möglich einen freien Tag und eine Uhrzeit, und erzähl mir deine Idee. Ich bestätige persönlich.", "Required. Everything else helps me prepare, but is optional.": "Pflichtfeld. Alles andere hilft mir bei der Vorbereitung, ist aber optional.", "1 · How much time?": "1 · Wie viel Zeit?", "2 · Which day?": "2 · Welcher Tag?", "optional": "optional", "3 · What time?": "3 · Um wie viel Uhr?", "Name": "Name", "Email": "E-Mail", "Phone number": "Telefonnummer", "Your general idea": "Deine grobe Idee", "Placement": "Platzierung", "Approximate size": "Ungefähre Größe", "Black or color": "Schwarz oder Farbe", "Not sure yet": "Noch unsicher", "Black": "Schwarz", "Color": "Farbe", "Reference material": "Referenzmaterial", "Add reference photos": "Referenzfotos hinzufügen", "drag them here or tap to choose · up to 8 photos": "hierher ziehen oder tippen zum Auswählen · bis zu 8 Fotos", "Is the tattoo going between existing ones? Please add a photo of the spot.": "Kommt das Tattoo zwischen bestehende? Dann bitte ein Foto der Stelle hinzufügen.", "Send my request": "Anfrage senden", "Prefer email?": "Lieber per E-Mail?", "Request sent": "Anfrage gesendet", "Tobias checks your idea and confirms by email, or suggests another time if the tattoo needs a different slot. You may be asked to pay a €50 deposit to make it final.": "Tobias prüft deine Idee und bestätigt per E-Mail oder schlägt eine andere Zeit vor, wenn das Tattoo einen anderen Termin braucht. Zur endgültigen Bestätigung wird eventuell eine Anzahlung von 50 € erbeten.", "Send another request": "Weitere Anfrage senden", "Aftercare": "Nachsorge", "Keep in mind: good aftercare is part of a good end result. Four phases, a few do's and don'ts.": "Denk daran: gute Nachsorge gehört zu einem guten Endergebnis. Vier Phasen, ein paar Dos und Don’ts.", "First hours": "Erste Stunden", "Foil &amp; first wash": "Folie &amp; erstes Waschen", "Keep the foil for at least three hours or overnight. Wash your hands with soap before handling your new tattoo.": "Lass die Folie mindestens drei Stunden oder über Nacht dran. Wasch dir die Hände mit Seife, bevor du dein neues Tattoo berührst.", "Remove the foil and wash the tattoo carefully with your hands to remove all surface blood, sweat and ink. To avoid irritation from the tape, remove the foil after a few minutes of showering.": "Entferne die Folie und wasche das Tattoo vorsichtig mit den Händen, um Blut, Schweiß und Farbe an der Oberfläche zu entfernen. Um Reizungen durch das Klebeband zu vermeiden, löse die Folie erst nach ein paar Minuten unter der Dusche.", "Clean with just water — pH-neutral soap can be used, but no normal soap. Rinse, then let it dry in open air or pat dry with a clean towel.": "Nur mit Wasser reinigen – pH-neutrale Seife ist möglich, normale Seife nicht. Abspülen, dann an der Luft trocknen lassen oder mit einem sauberen Handtuch trocken tupfen.", "Day 1 – 14": "Tag 1 – 14", "Thin layer of cream": "Dünne Schicht Creme", "We advise Cicaplast B5 or Easy Tattoo. Always apply a thin layer of ointment, 3 to 6 times a day for at least 14 days to maintain hydration.": "Wir empfehlen Cicaplast B5 oder Easy Tattoo. Trage immer eine dünne Schicht Salbe auf, 3- bis 6-mal täglich für mindestens 14 Tage, um die Haut feucht zu halten.", "It helps the tattoo settle nicely if you keep going for an extra 2 weeks.": "Es hilft dem Tattoo, sich schön zu setzen, wenn du noch 2 Wochen länger weitermachst.", "You may refilm for two nights to avoid stains in your bed — also if you have a dirty job. Keep your tattoo open for the rest of the time.": "Du kannst zwei Nächte lang neu abdecken, um Flecken im Bett zu vermeiden – auch bei schmutziger Arbeit. Lass das Tattoo die restliche Zeit offen.", "Day 3 – 7 and on": "Tag 3 – 7 und danach", "Peeling &amp; scabbing": "Schuppen &amp; Krusten", "The tattoo may start to peel and scab. Don't pick or peel the skin away — let it fall off naturally during washing or applying cream. Fresh skin will soon replace the dead skin.": "Das Tattoo kann anfangen zu schuppen und Krusten zu bilden. Nicht kratzen oder abziehen – lass die Haut beim Waschen oder Eincremen von selbst abfallen. Frische Haut ersetzt bald die abgestorbene.", "The ink may fade during the process, but will return when healing is completed. Too dry skin will crust and push ink out. With a real crust, increase cream frequency — but always apply slightly: too much prevents the skin from breathing.": "Die Farbe kann während des Prozesses blasser wirken, kommt aber nach der Heilung zurück. Zu trockene Haut verkrustet und drückt Farbe heraus. Bei echter Kruste öfter eincremen – aber immer dünn: zu viel hindert die Haut am Atmen.", "After a few months": "Nach ein paar Monaten", "Sun": "Sonne", "After a few months you may sunbathe in moderation.": "Nach ein paar Monaten darfst du in Maßen sonnenbaden.", "Use sun cream, factor 50, to prevent early fading. Exposure to the sun is the major cause of tattoo fading.": "Benutze Sonnencreme mit Faktor 50, um frühes Verblassen zu verhindern. Sonne ist die Hauptursache für verblassende Tattoos.", "Do": "Dos", "Change your bed sheets if you have pets entering the bedroom.": "Wechsle die Bettwäsche, wenn Haustiere ins Schlafzimmer kommen.", "Continue applying cream as long as the tattoo feels sensitive.": "Creme weiter, solange das Tattoo empfindlich ist.", "Keep in mind good aftercare is part of a good end result!": "Denk daran: gute Nachsorge gehört zu einem guten Endergebnis!", "Get in touch if your tattoo needs a touch-up.": "Melde dich, wenn dein Tattoo nachgestochen werden muss.", "Get in touch if you're worried about the healing process or have an infection.": "Melde dich, wenn du dir Sorgen um die Heilung machst oder eine Infektion hast.", "Don't": "Don’ts", "Apply Vaseline or petroleum-based products.": "Vaseline oder Produkte auf Erdölbasis auftragen.", "Apply alcohol.": "Alkohol auftragen.", "Rub, scratch or pick at the tattoo.": "Am Tattoo reiben, kratzen oder pulen.", "Expose the tattoo to direct sunlight.": "Das Tattoo direkter Sonne aussetzen.", "Swim — no sauna, no steam bath or bathtub for 3 to 4 weeks.": "Schwimmen – 3 bis 4 Wochen keine Sauna, kein Dampfbad, keine Badewanne.", "Happy <span>healing!</span>": "Happy <span>healing!</span>", "The shop": "Der Shop", "Prints and goods by Tobias De Bruyn, available in the online shop.": "Prints und Goods von Tobias De Bruyn, erhältlich im Online-Shop.", "Visit the shop ↗": "Zum Shop ↗", "Come by — by appointment": "Komm vorbei – nach Vereinbarung", "<a href=\"#booking\">Use the booking form</a> — pick a free slot and send your idea": "<a href=\"#booking\">Nutze das Buchungsformular</a> – wähle einen freien Termin und sende deine Idee", "Email · for info and booking": "E-Mail · für Infos und Termine", "Tattoo studio": "Tattoostudio", "Opening": "Öffnungszeiten", "Private studio · only by appointment": "Privates Studio · nur nach Vereinbarung", "Route via Google Maps": "Route über Google Maps", "Photography by Jannis Bachard": "Fotografie: Jannis Bachard", "e.g. A panther head on my forearm, black. Or: I'd like to drop by first to discuss my project — which mornings at 9 or 10 suit you? Or ask for a different time slot.": "z. B. Ein Pantherkopf auf meinem Unterarm, schwarz. Oder: Ich würde gern erst vorbeikommen, um mein Projekt zu besprechen – welche Vormittage um 9 oder 10 Uhr passen? Oder frag nach einer anderen Zeit.", "e.g. upper arm": "z. B. Oberarm", "e.g. 15 cm": "z. B. 15 cm", "All work": "Alle Arbeiten", "Animals": "Tiere", "Colour": "Farbe", "Show more": "Mehr anzeigen", "Enlarge": "Vergrößern", "Consultation": "Beratung", "Small": "Klein", "Medium": "Mittel", "Full day": "Ganzer Tag", "Discuss your project or browse flash": "Projekt besprechen oder Flash ansehen", "hour": "Stunde", "hours": "Stunden", "Previous month": "Vorheriger Monat", "Next month": "Nächster Monat", "Mo,Tu,We,Th,Fr,Sa,Su": "Mo,Di,Mi,Do,Fr,Sa,So", "Choose how much time you need first — the free days then light up.": "Wähle zuerst, wie viel Zeit du brauchst – dann leuchten die freien Tage auf.", "Choose a day first — or skip this and just send your request.": "Wähle zuerst einen Tag – oder überspringe das und sende einfach deine Anfrage.", "held for you as soon as you send": "wird beim Senden für dich reserviert", "Pick a start time, or unselect the day.": "Wähle eine Startzeit oder hebe die Tagesauswahl auf.", "your name": "deinen Namen", "a valid email address": "eine gültige E-Mail-Adresse", "your phone number": "deine Telefonnummer", "your idea": "deine Idee", "Please fill in": "Bitte ausfüllen:", "Sending…": "Wird gesendet…", "is held for you.": "ist für dich reserviert.", "No slot chosen — I'll get back to you by email with a proposal for a date.": "Kein Termin gewählt – ich melde mich per E-Mail mit einem Datumsvorschlag.", "Sorry, that time was just taken. Please pick another one.": "Sorry, dieser Termin wurde gerade vergeben. Bitte wähle einen anderen.", "Something went wrong while sending. Please try again, or email me directly.": "Beim Senden ist etwas schiefgelaufen. Versuch es noch einmal oder schreib mir direkt.", "No slot chosen": "Kein Termin gewählt", "Modern traditional tattoo": "Modern Traditional Tattoo", "American traditional tattoo": "American Traditional Tattoo", "Western traditional tattoo": "Western Traditional Tattoo", "Neo traditional tattoo": "Neo Traditional Tattoo", "tag:large": "Backpieces", "tag:classics": "Classics", "tag:early": "Frühe Arbeiten", "tag:a-bat": "Fledermaus", "tag:a-bear": "Bär", "tag:a-bee": "Biene", "tag:a-bird": "Vogel", "tag:a-butterfly": "Schmetterling", "tag:a-cat": "Katze", "tag:a-dog": "Hund", "tag:a-dragon": "Drache", "tag:a-eagle": "Adler", "tag:a-horse": "Pferd", "tag:a-koi-fish": "Koi", "tag:a-lion": "Löwe", "tag:a-moth": "Motte", "tag:a-owl": "Eule", "tag:a-panther": "Panther", "tag:a-rooster": "Hahn", "tag:a-scorpion": "Skorpion", "tag:a-shark": "Hai", "tag:a-snake": "Schlange", "tag:a-spider": "Spinne", "tag:a-swallow": "Schwalbe", "tag:a-tiger": "Tiger", "tag:a-wolf": "Wolf", "tag:tmu5fu1v0": "Aktuelle Arbeiten", "tag:tmu5fyc52": "Nautisch", "tag:tmu5fyndd": "Ladies & Gesichter", "tag:tmu5fytv8": "Pflanzen & Blumen", "tag:tmu5fyyyj": "Totenköpfe", "tag:tmu5fz3um": "Objekte", "tag:tmu5fzg7s": "Herzen & Liebe", "tag:tmu5g45hx": "Dolche & Waffen", "tag:a-tmu5g52de": "Insekten", "tag:tmu5g6u6t": "Kreativ", "tag:tmu5ga1to": "Figuren & Berufe", "tag:tmu5gbxa1": "Bruststücke", "tag:a-tmu5gox7m": "Wal", "tag:l-back": "Rücken", "tag:l-arm": "Arm", "tag:l-lower-arm": "Unterarm", "tag:l-leg": "Bein", "tag:l-front": "Vorderseite", "tag:a-crocodile": "Krokodil", "tag:a-insect": "Insekt", "tag:c-color": "Farbe", "tag:c-bg": "Schwarz & Grau", "tag:s-psychedelic": "Psychedelisch", "tag:s-surreal": "Surreal", "tag:s-fillers": "Filler", "tag:s-railway": "Eisenbahn", "tag:s-flash": "Flash", "tag:s-modern": "Modern", "tag:s-nature": "Natur", "Modern &amp; aesthetic traditional tattoo artist based in Antwerp, working from a private studio by appointment. Rooted in traditional western tattooing, adding a bit of new imagery and creativity. Classic and bold, to withstand time, fading and trendyness. Working from flash and happy to create custom pieces.": "Moderner &amp; ästhetischer Traditional Tattoo Artist in Antwerpen, der in einem privaten Studio nach Vereinbarung arbeitet. Verwurzelt im traditionellen westlichen Tätowieren, ergänzt um neue Bildsprache und Kreativität. Klassisch und bold – gemacht, um Zeit, Verblassen und Trends zu überstehen. Ich arbeite mit Flash und entwerfe gern individuelle Motive.", "10+ years": "10+ Jahre", "of experience": "Erfahrung", "Instagram": "Instagram", "Clean lines, solid colour and strong contrasts. Careful placement, and work that stays readable for many years.": "Klare Linien, satte Farben und starke Kontraste. Sorgfältige Platzierung und Arbeiten, die viele Jahre lesbar bleiben.", "Pick a free slot for your tattoo and tell me what you have in mind. Rather drop by first to talk it through? Just mention which mornings at 9 or 10 suit you. Nothing that suits — evenings, or my days off? Send the request anyway, or email me, and we'll find a moment together. Every request is confirmed by me personally, by email.": "Wähle einen freien Termin für dein Tattoo und erzähl mir, was du dir vorstellst. Lieber erst vorbeikommen und besprechen? Schreib einfach dazu, welche Vormittage um 9 oder 10 Uhr dir passen. Passt nichts – abends, oder an meinen freien Tagen? Sende die Anfrage trotzdem oder schreib mir, dann finden wir gemeinsam einen Moment. Jede Anfrage bestätige ich persönlich per E-Mail.", "<strong>Pick a slot &amp; send your idea</strong>Choose how much time you'll need, a free day and a time. Add your general idea, placement, black or color and reference pictures. The slot is held for you while I have a look.": "<strong>Termin wählen &amp; Idee senden</strong>Wähle, wie viel Zeit du brauchst, einen freien Tag und eine Uhrzeit. Ergänze deine grobe Idee, Platzierung, Schwarz oder Farbe und Referenzbilder. Der Termin wird für dich reserviert, während ich mir alles ansehe.", "<strong>I confirm by email</strong>I check your idea and confirm your slot — or suggest a different day or duration if the piece needs it. With enough information I can give you an estimated price. Nothing is final before my confirmation; once confirmed, I may ask you to pay a €50 deposit.": "<strong>Ich bestätige per E-Mail</strong>Ich prüfe deine Idee und bestätige den Termin – oder schlage einen anderen Tag oder eine andere Dauer vor, wenn das Motiv es braucht. Mit genug Informationen kann ich einen Richtpreis nennen. Nichts ist endgültig vor meiner Bestätigung; danach bitte ich eventuell um eine Anzahlung von 50 €.", "<strong>We fine-tune the design together</strong>I can sketch in advance and send it the week before for feedback, or draw it out on the appointment. Together we make the final drawing, keeping details to size and placement in mind. There are a lot of line drawings ready to go as well. Then: one client at a time, in a calm private studio.": "<strong>Wir feilen gemeinsam am Entwurf</strong>Ich kann vorab skizzieren und den Entwurf in der Woche davor zum Feedback schicken, oder ihn beim Termin ausarbeiten. Gemeinsam machen wir die endgültige Zeichnung, mit Details passend zu Größe und Platzierung. Es liegen auch viele fertige Linienzeichnungen bereit. Und dann: ein Kunde nach dem anderen, in einem ruhigen privaten Studio.", "How much time do you need?": "Wie viel Zeit brauchst du?", "Pick how much time you need and, if you can, a free day and time. Then tell me your idea — I confirm by email.": "Wähle, wie viel Zeit du brauchst, und wenn möglich einen freien Tag und eine Uhrzeit. Dann erzähl mir deine Idee – ich bestätige per E-Mail.", "If you want to discuss your project, let me know which mornings at 9 or 10 you can come to the studio.": "Wenn du dein Projekt besprechen möchtest, sag mir, an welchen Vormittagen um 9 oder 10 Uhr du ins Studio kommen kannst.", "You'll get a confirmation by email — nothing is final until then.": "Du bekommst eine Bestätigung per E-Mail – bis dahin ist nichts endgültig.", "Keep in mind: good aftercare is part of a good end result.": "Denk daran: gute Nachsorge gehört zu einem guten Endergebnis.", "Come by": "Komm vorbei", "more": "mehr", "less": "weniger", "Style": "Stil", "tag:y-modern": "Modern Traditional Tattoo", "tag:y-american": "American Traditional Tattoo", "tag:y-western": "Western Traditional Tattoo", "tag:y-neo": "Neo Traditional Tattoo", "tagl:daggers": "Dolche", "tagl:dagger": "Dolch", "tagl:custom": "Custom", "tagl:back piece": "Backpiece", "tagl:objects": "Objekte", "tagl:classics": "Classics", "tagl:flash": "Flash", "tagl:fillers": "Filler", "Choose how much time you need": "Wähle, wie viel Zeit du brauchst", "Close": "Schließen", "Filter tattoos by category": "Tattoos nach Kategorie filtern", "Language": "Sprache", "Main": "Hauptmenü", "Next": "Weiter", "Previous": "Zurück", "Tattoo enlarged": "Tattoo vergrößert", "What to expect": "Was dich erwartet", "Switch between dark and light": "Zwischen Dunkel und Hell wechseln", "Switch to light": "Zu Hell wechseln", "Switch to dark": "Zu Dunkel wechseln"};

